## Modification

You can add a new column...

```{r, echo=TRUE}
# Adding a new variable to the data frame
df$in_stock <- c(1,1,1,0)
df
```

Or you can drop it...

```{r}
# Adding a new variable to the data frame
df$consolidate <- NULL
df
```

You can modify a single value...

```{r}
# Modifying an specific value
df[1, "share_dif"] <- df[1, "share_dif"] + 1.4
df
```
